# Build and check package and documentation artifacts

tags: build docs

This shell script chooses a local virtualenv when present, builds Python distributions, validates them with Twine, and builds the MkDocs site. CI calls it through `/github/encode/httpx/.github/workflows/test-suite.yml`. It relies on `/github/encode/httpx/pyproject.toml`, `/github/encode/httpx/mkdocs.yml`, and pinned tools in `/github/encode/httpx/requirements.txt`.
